				"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/accounts/avatars/109/286/461/031/266/152/original/dc489c3746a44e00.png"
			},
			"date": "2024-10-28T15:21:44.442Z",
			"content": "<p>Closely watching Croissant 👀  <a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@BenRiceM/113385700599364899\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">mastodon.social/@BenRiceM/1133</span><span class=\"invisible\">85700599364899</span></a></p><p><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/croissant-cross-posting/id6670288979\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">apps.apple.com/us/app/croissan</span><span class=\"invisible\">t-cross-posting/id6670288979</span></a></p><p>(via <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://narrativ.es/@janl\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>janl</span></a></span>)</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "113385741007329364",
			"parentId": "113385713806361272",
			"url": "https://social.coop/@luis_in_brief/113385740932931168",
			"author": {
				"name": "Luis Villa",
				"url": "https://social.coop/@luis_in_brief",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/463/306/329/053/914/original/a6727cc5b53bfaef.jpeg"
			},
			"date": "2024-10-28T15:25:03.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://narrativ.es/@janl\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>janl</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@BenRiceM\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>BenRiceM</span></a></span> fair! </p><p>Let me phrase it more constructively: coming from someone who really appreciates high-quality software, pays for a lot of it, and literally works all day (when not poasting) to support solo software developers: the price, given the important *but limited* functionality, feels too high and will be hard to justify in the market going forward. As someone who wants you to succeed, I suspect you either need to improve the feature set or lower the price.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "113385759778334876",
			"parentId": "113385741007329364",
			"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat/113385759778334876",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/accounts/avatars/109/286/461/031/266/152/original/dc489c3746a44e00.png"
			},
			"date": "2024-10-28T15:29:51.149Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://social.coop/@luis_in_brief\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>luis_in_brief</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://narrativ.es/@janl\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>janl</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@BenRiceM\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>BenRiceM</span></a></span> to be clear—this service costs $3 a month, no? I’m currently using Buffer, which costs $5 per channel per month</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "113385779489000366",
			"parentId": "113385759778334876",
			"url": "https://mastodon.social/@BenRiceM/113385779214577690",
			"author": {
				"name": "BenRiceM",
				"url": "https://mastodon.social/@BenRiceM",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/405/079/905/661/141/original/8e2b2196ce642b57.png"
			},
			"date": "2024-10-28T15:34:47.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://social.coop/@luis_in_brief\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>luis_in_brief</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://narrativ.es/@janl\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>janl</span></a></span> I think that’s correct. Buffer is $60 per year per service, Croissant is $20 for the three services we support</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "113385785905545705",
			"parentId": "113385741007329364",
			"url": "https://mastodon.social/@BenRiceM/113385785815209678",
			"author": {
				"name": "BenRiceM",
				"url": "https://mastodon.social/@BenRiceM",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/405/079/905/661/141/original/8e2b2196ce642b57.png"
			},
			"date": "2024-10-28T15:36:28.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://social.coop/@luis_in_brief\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>luis_in_brief</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://narrativ.es/@janl\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>janl</span></a></span> improving the feature set is definitely the plan we want to add iPad and Mac apps, and features like history and scheduled posts. </p><p>But we also thought given that it’s a subscription, better to start high and if needed, lower the price, rather then start too low and have to “bait and switch” existing users by raising the price</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
