			},
			"date": "2024-10-28T15:38:13.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@BenRiceM\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>BenRiceM</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://social.coop/@luis_in_brief\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>luis_in_brief</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Ivory did the same, while publicly stating what they are working on next before they consider “the price justified” because enough people wanted even just a barebones version.</p><p>I think it’s a great strategy. ✌️</p>",
